          hangar opens (run_20260730_082408, _083652) - the filter enters, computes, and reaches
          the send. build_ingame_pkt is a 3-line byte-packer that cannot raise on that input, and
          the send_reply thread is spawned right after.
        * The reason NO run ever showed the 'catalog filtered' confirmation: fa_logging._TAG_LEVELS
          maps 'POST-AUTH' -> DEBUG, and the file log level defaults to INFO
          (FILE_LOG_LEVEL_DEFAULT='INFO'). Every POST-AUTH line, including the filter confirmation,
