          world has no Bigalon/Taurus object: he is BLIND, and inbound hits reference objects
          that are gone -> 'Get coord for missing object 258/259' flood, hits ignored.
        * Server-side proof of the gap: after Gary's 17:06:21 respawn, ZERO CREATE2 fired
          TOWARD Gary (contrast the working 17:02 entry, which created both peers onto him).
