      (_hq_reentry_pending unset) and never changes airfield (af_changed false), so neither
      re-advertise trigger ran. The bail-respawn was simply never wired to peer re-advertise.

      FIX: at the bail-respawn detection in _fire_server_confirm (where bailed_plane_obj is
      consumed), drop our addr from every peer's _created_peers so the relay re-creates their
