      form has a complete handler (v327 family). The 0xd2 scan branch was the one
      fallback still answering with a placeholder echo. ACKs were healthy throughout:
      client-measured RTT 11-17ms (the preserved 10ms pacing + loopback), Resend Time
      5000 never hit, zero retransmits in 15k vcnc lines.
      WHY IT LOOKED NEW: whether the arena page populated depended on whether the Arenas
      tab was opened inside the window where the resync attach claimed the 210. v356
      sessions won that race; this one lost it.

      FIX: the scan-shaped 0xd2 now routes to send_arenalist_with_gamedefs exactly like
      the direct sub==0xd2 branch (212 GAME_DEFs first, then the list, per v164). Applied
