        * NOT auto-resupply. Only 2 pilots were ever air-resupplied (_AvA_Insane x3,
          AC2E_Bigalon x1) and _AvA_Insane - the most resupplied - never froze or stalled once,
          while 5 pilots who were never resupplied did freeze.
        * NOT reliable-channel loss. The grant went out in the SAME MILLISECOND as the request.
