            Rank              -> f0   (u8)    Lost Pilots      -> f1   (u16)
            Kills > Fighters  -> f2   (u16)   Kills > Bombers  -> f3   (u16)
            Kills             -> f5   (u16)   Kills In A Row   -> f7   (u8)
